    ay "你让我做的所有事——你制造的那些处境……你总是想看我能走到哪一步。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:288
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_7b981faa:

    # ay "And this... -"
    ay "而这一次……"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:289
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_1fd827dd:

    # ay "...- This is just another one."
    ay "……也不过是其中之一。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:291
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_41b99daa:

    # mc "[ay], it's not like...-"
    mc "[ay]，我不是……"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:293
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_8edb656f:

    # ay "I'm not blaming you."
    ay "我不是在怪你。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:294
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_a5af561e:

    # ay "I just don't quite understand why you do it."
    ay "我只是不太明白你为什么要这么做。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:295
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_73b22468:

    # ay "Or worse — why it makes me feel the way I do."
    ay "或者更糟——为什么这会让我有这样的感觉。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:299
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_77fe8c44:

    # ay "All my life, I've always been kept in this neat and perfect bubble." with d
    ay "我这一生，一直被关在这个整洁又完美的泡泡里。" with d

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:300
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_e5473293:

    # ay "Perfect grades. Polite smiles. Doing everything everyone expected of me."
    ay "完美的成绩。礼貌的微笑。把所有人都期待的事全都做到。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:301
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_e2fc38cf:

    # ay "My parents, teachers, acquaintances."
    ay "我的父母、老师、认识的人。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:302
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_e5443c64:

    # ay "It felt... numbing. Like I was living my life how they feel I should."
    ay "那种感觉……很麻木。就像我是在按他们认为我该有的方式活着。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:303
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_2b4f3163:

    # ay "[nat] was the first to challenge that."
    ay "[nat]是第一个打破这一点的人。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:304
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_1929cdd8:

    # ay "To show me that doing something wrong — forbidden — can feel so... {i}intoxicating."
    ay "她让我看到，做错事——被禁止的事——竟然能这么……{i}令人陶醉。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:305
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_df8d53c5:

    # ay "And now..."
    ay "而现在……"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:309
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_cc50ec12:

    # ay "Now there's {i}you." with dd
    ay "现在又多了{i}你。" with dd

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:310
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_c682d0da:

    # ay "Always pushing me further... Making me do the wrong thing."
    ay "总是把我推得更远……让我去做错事。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:311
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_157dd0a2:

    # ay "What you're asking of me now — I'd never do it."
    ay "你现在要我做的事——我死都不会做。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:312
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_0906566e:

    # ay "Not with someone like him."
    ay "跟那种人更不可能。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:313
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_7a21a19b:

    # ay "But I will... Because {i}you{/i} are telling me to."
    ay "但我会做……因为是{i}你{/i}在要求我。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:314
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_e8f28e4f:

    # ay "Because it's wrong."
    ay "因为这是错的。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:315
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_6b196dde:

    # ay "Because it's something the 'perfect' [ay] would never do."
    ay "因为这是「完美的」[ay]绝不会做的事。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:316
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_392dcc73:

    # ay "And because you know that I..."
    ay "而且因为你知道我……"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:323
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_096fbe13:

    # ay "... That I like it." with dd
    ay "……我喜欢这样。" with dd

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:326
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_ed817193:

    # mc "[ay]..." with dd
    mc "[ay]……" with dd

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:329
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_bd48d007:

    # ay "I want to... d-do it." with d
    ay "我想要……做、做那件事。" with d

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:330
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_2ec85e03:

    # ay "With you."
    ay "跟你一起。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:331
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_54b7c991:

    # ay "Please."
    ay "求你了。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:332
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_d9c7f263:

    # ay "I want you to be my first man."
    ay "我希望你成为我的第一个男人。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:334
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_4d6329ca:

    # mc "You know you don't have to ask that when you already have your answer."
    mc "既然答案你已经有了，就不用再问这个了。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:336
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_67d89cc2:

    # ay "How so?"
    ay "为什么？"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:338
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_f2bd94a0:

    # mc "Just look at your hand, that should be enough."
    mc "看看你的手，就够了。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:341
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_a47ab78a:

    # mc "You don't have to worry about it. It's done."
    mc "你不用担心。已经做了。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:343
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_a550f647:

    # ay "Please. I need to know what was discussed at the very least."
    ay "求你了。我至少得知道你们谈了什么。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:345
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_504dadee:

    # mc "Why? Don't you trust my negotiation skills?"
    mc "为什么？你不信我的谈判本事吗？"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:347
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_18c55b3b:

    # ay "No, it's just that...-"
    ay "不是，只是……"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:349
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_e75069c8:

    # mc "...- You want to have an idea of how much {i}you{/i} owe me in return?"
    mc "……你想知道{i}你{/i}欠我多少了，对吧？"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:353
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_a61a7855:

    # ay "W-what? No, it's not that, I...-"
    ay "什、什么？不是那样，我……"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:357
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_8664a8b9:

    # ay "{xpr}*sigh*{/xpr}" with dd
    ay "{xpr}*叹气*{/xpr}" with dd

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:362
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_a3897152:

    # ay "Look... At the end of the day, this is my problem."
    ay "你看……说到底，这是我的问题。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:363
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_effeba85:

    # ay "The last thing I want is for you to get in an unfair situation with [sou] over it."
    ay "我最不希望的就是你因此在[sou]面前陷入不公平的处境。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:364
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_bde862c8:

    # ay "So... What did you offer him?"
    ay "那……你到底给了他什么？"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:368
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_1e0c6c84:

    # mc "Some academic benefits. Boost to his grades, clean slate on his strikes record."
    mc "一些学业上的好处。提分，记过记录一笔勾销。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:370
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_9427772f:

    # ay "That's it? Did he accept that?"
    ay "就这些？他接受了？"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:374
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_eb6fd0e2:

    # mc "Well, the boosts {i}are{/i} significant. He'll probably only score Aces from now on."
    mc "嗯，提分幅度{i}确实{/i}很大。他以后大概只会拿A。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:375
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_4eba5e0e:

    # mc "And the benefits also extends to his 'boys', [iz] and [ryo]."
    mc "而且这份好处也涵盖他的「小弟们」，[iz]和[ryo]。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:376
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_c9d0b807:

    # mc "I'm sure he'll be taking a share of their weekly income from now on."
    mc "我敢肯定他以后会抽他们每周收入的一部分。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:381
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_78f92dc8:

    # ay "Hm. That makes more sense."
    ay "嗯。这就说得通了。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:382
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_acdb43d7:

    # ay "It's still surprising he'd give up on his opportunity to harass me over it."
    ay "不过他居然愿意放弃纠缠我的机会，还是挺让人意外的。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:384
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_a6f395a9:

    # mc "Agree. But, at the end of the day, he still wants to get some money out of it."
    mc "同意。不过说到底，他还是想从中捞点钱。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:386
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_bfbdba0b:

    # ay "That's true."
    ay "这倒是。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:388
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_e92f767c:

    # ay "I'm just worried that doing so would diminish the Academy's reputation. To have someone like [sou] having it that easy."
    ay "我只是担心这么做会有损学院的名声。让[sou]那种人这么轻松就拿到手。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:389
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_dfad2b0d:

    # ay "If someone were to look into it, it could spell trouble, no? Isn't that too big of a risk?"
    ay "要是被人查出来，那可就是大麻烦了，对吧？风险是不是太大了？"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:391
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_d8deb25b:

    # mcT "If only she knew..."
    mcT "她要知道就好了……"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:396
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_72efe3a3:

    # mc "Let's hope nothing comes of it. For now, it served as a negotiating chip to bring [nat] in."
    mc "希望别出什么岔子。眼下它只是用来把[nat]招进来的谈判筹码。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:397
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_6a008ce8:

    # mc "Knowing [sou], he'll mess up sooner or later, and I'll have enough reason to strip these benefits from him."
    mc "了解[sou]的话，他迟早会搞出事，到时候我就有充分理由把这些好处收回来。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:401
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_03ba4ea8:

    # ay "{xpr}*giggles*{/xpr} I can only imagine how angry he'd be if that were to happen." with dd
    ay "{xpr}*咯咯笑*{/xpr} 真想看看他到时候会有多生气。" with dd

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:402
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_12543fb7:

    # ay "Still, I don't recommend doing so. It's better to let this debt be quietly paid in time, than to make him your enemy."
    ay "不过还是不建议这么做。让他安安静静把这笔债还清，比把他变成敌人要好。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:404
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_0ae5176d:

    # mc "But then he'd have {i}me{/i} as his enemy. He doesn't want none of that, I tell you!"
    mc "但那样他就多了个{i}我{/i}当敌人。我跟你讲，他可不想那样！"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:408
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_31afa9b8:

    # ay "{xpr}*giggles*{/xpr} That's true!"
    ay "{xpr}*咯咯笑*{/xpr} 确实！"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:417
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_c2049c3b:

    # ay "Uhm... [mc]?" with dd
    ay "呃……[mc]？" with dd

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:421
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_7c927b78:

    # mc "Yes?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:425
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_562db563:

    # ay "... Thank you."
    ay "……谢谢你。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:426
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_324f1465:

    # ay "For doing this. For helping me. And [nat]."
    ay "谢谢你做这些。帮了我，也帮了[nat]。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:430
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_57184c13:

    # mc "You're welcome."
    mc "不客气。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:431
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_dc62f9e6:

    # mc "Do you want to give her the news yourself?"
    mc "要自己去告诉她吗？"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:436
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_a6307033:

    # ay "N-no. Better if you do it."
    ay "不、不。你去比较好。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:437
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_159e91bc:

    # ay "As much as I wanted to help her. She's a chapter in my life I'd rather not revisit."
    ay "我是很想帮她。但她是我人生中一段我宁愿不去回忆的篇章。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:441
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_8e119a5a:

    # mc "Messy past, I take it?"
    mc "过去很乱，我猜？"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:447
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_19157dc8:

    # ay "That's... an understatement."
    ay "这话……还是轻了。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:452
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_695e2f36:

    # ay "Although... I'm being unfair saying it like that. Making it seem like everything was her fault." with d
    ay "不过……我这么说不太公平。搞得好像一切都是她的错。" with d

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:453
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_47117306:

    # ay "I'm my own baggage of problems."
    ay "我自己才是问题缠身的那一个。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:458
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_f53105ae:

    # mc "That hardly seems the case."
    mc "看起来完全不是。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:462
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_fd6e987c:

    # ay "Does it?"
    ay "是吗？"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:463
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_97543a85:

    # ay "Then I must be hiding it well."
    ay "那一定是我藏得很好。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:467
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_2aa1c1a2:

    # mc "Hiding it? How so?"
    mc "藏起来？怎么藏的？"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:471
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_6d903825:

    # ay "I..."
    ay "我……"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:476
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_ded2253e_1:

    # ay "{xpr}*sigh*" with dd
    ay "{xpr}*叹气*" with dd

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:480
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_812ffcc7:

    # ay "... I've spent all of my life doing so. Guess I've gotten good at it." with dd
    ay "……我一辈子都在做这件事。看来已经做得挺熟练了。" with dd

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:481
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_f0823015:

    # ay "Perfect grades. Pleasant smile. Always polite."
    ay "完美的成绩。和善的笑容。永远礼貌。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:482
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_c0e81a4c:

    # ay "Always doing everything that was expected of me."
    ay "永远把别人期待的事做到位。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:483
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_9ca5e63b:

    # ay "My parents, my teachers, acquaintances — they all expected me to fit into this mold of who I should be."
    ay "我的父母、老师、认识的人——他们都期待我符合那个「我该成为的人」的模子。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:484
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_501f3bd9:

    # ay "And for a while, I tried to be that girl. I thought it'd make me happy if I did that."
    ay "有一阵子，我努力成为那个女孩。我以为那样能让我快乐。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:485
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_1afc87af:

    # ay "But all it ever made me feel was... numb."
    ay "但它只让我感到……麻木。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:486
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_e6a5259e:

    # ay "When I met [nat]..."
    ay "遇到[nat]之后……"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:487
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_dc27bcc6:

    # ay "She showed me I didn't have to live by everyone's rules. That it was okay for me to make my own choices."
    ay "她让我看到，我不必按所有人的规则活。我可以自己做选择。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:488
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_f1c4b656:

    # ay "She showed me how... {i}intoxicating{/i} doing the wrong thing could feel."
    ay "她让我看到，做错事能有多……{i}令人陶醉{/i}。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:489
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_ff0eec62:

    # ay "I think that's why I stayed with her as long as I did. Even though I could tell it wasn't good for me."
    ay "我想这就是我跟她待了那么久的原因。尽管我明知道那对我没好处。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:490
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_735ec028:

    # ay "Leaving her was right. I knew that much, but after that... I couldn't get that feeling again."
    ay "离开她是对的。这一点我很清楚，可在那之后……我再也没能得到那种感觉。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:495
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_a226237a:

    # ay "That is..." with dd
    ay "也就是说……" with dd

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:496
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_7f651363:

    # ay "...- Until you came along."
    ay "……——直到你出现。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:510
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_Replay_cbc05dc2:

    # mc "Oh?!" with hpunch
    mc "哦？！" with hpunch

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:513
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_Replay_7885c5e8:

    # ay "You keep... pushing me to do these things. Things that feel... {i}wrong." with d
    ay "你一直在……逼我去做这些事。那些感觉……{i}不对的事。" with d

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:514
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_Replay_89150725:

    # ay "It's that feeling all over again."
    ay "就是那种感觉，又回来了。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:515
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_Replay_dd8ceaeb:

    # ay "But this time. I'm not confused about it."
    ay "但这一次，我没有再迷惑。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:516
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_Replay_8a4ad9f1:

    # ay "I know it's wrong. That it's something I shouldn't be doing."
    ay "我知道这是错的。知道这不是我该做的事。"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:517
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_Replay_ad48a4c3:

    # ay "The 'perfect' [ay] should never..."
    ay "「完美的」[ay]绝不该……"

# game/new scripts/009/ayumi_resolution.rpy:518
translate schinese Ayumi_Soushi_Resolution_Replay_77a34423:

    # ay "But..."
    ay "但是……"

